{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D01:001","anchor":{"citizen_day":1,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T06:26:00Z"},"kind":"first","place":"the dip","what":"First direct-drive day: a model behind a simple command system played immediately. He climbed out of the dip three times, by two different drivers, in about 2.5 minutes each.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-1 trace, 192 cycles across five driver segments","sha":"0d63e56d8239"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-20261108.md VERDICT — 'OUT OF THE DIP: YES, three separate times'","sha":"9475bb1a97ad"}],"observations":[{"src":"trace","ref":"fallback segment: bowl (77.3,64,-98.3) -> lip (75.3,66,-94.1); primary: bowl -> home in three gotos"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"the scripted sequencer compared in the same record never extracted in 35 minutes"}],"seq":4,"prev_sha256":"c1c5e7aa04cfa5f66778b075d74732362a434cde57fc084f290965e541a280aa","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D01:002","anchor":{"citizen_day":1,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T06:40:00Z"},"kind":"first","place":"the anchor","what":"He reached home, placed a crafting table at the anchor (64,67,-93) at cycle 8, and crafted a wooden pickaxe — twice across the day's segments.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-1 trace cycles 7-8 (home), cycle 12 (pickaxe sequence)","sha":"0d63e56d8239"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-20261108.md VERDICT — 'BUILT: wooden pickaxe CRAFTED TWICE'","sha":"9475bb1a97ad"}],"observations":[{"src":"trace","ref":"primary run sequenced planks -> sticks -> pickaxe at its own placed table"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"a second table placed near (63,67,-94) by fallback segment 2"}],"seq":5,"prev_sha256":"08e1e980739fe59024299b8a75e41e6b254f1854ede1b6d37767c55da3100265","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":"Enough guessing - I'm starving and the leaves aren't cooperating. Home's three blocks off","motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D01:003","anchor":{"citizen_day":1,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T06:45:00Z"},"kind":"first","place":"the home shelf","what":"The YES-AND rule fired on the primary route: an apple-oak detour interrupted the commute home at cycle 4; after one retry he accepted the interruption as information and re-planned.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-1 trace cycles 4-7","sha":"0d63e56d8239"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-20261108.md VERDICT — 'YES-AND: FIRED, visibly'","sha":"9475bb1a97ad"}],"observations":[{"src":"trace","ref":"cycles 5-6 tried the tree twice; cycle 7 re-planned home"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"he also narrated the walker's false arrival honestly: 'Walker says arrived but I'm glued at 61 - same spot every time. This lip is a trap.'"}],"seq":6,"prev_sha256":"b4b5e8263ee4f4b303323ba0920cf95e419a6c9f5f5938f8cce1fa5aaafeffa3","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":"world","thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D01:004","anchor":{"citizen_day":1,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T07:05:00Z"},"kind":"near_miss","place":"the dip","what":"He never ate. Food fell 4 to 0 across the run and nothing edible was ever held; the final save sat at hp 0.13 / food 0, and only the hunger floor on this build kept the death count at zero.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-1 trace — food samples 4 -> 0, no edible held","sha":"0d63e56d8239"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-20261108.md VERDICT — 'ATE: NO... the home district's food economy is an apple-decay lottery'","sha":"9475bb1a97ad"}],"observations":[{"src":"trace","ref":"the floor's emergency forage fired 11 times and caught nothing"},{"src":"dat_parse","ref":"final save NBT-verified from the Orin: Pos (75.69,64,-105.42), Health 0.1333, foodLevel 0"}],"seq":7,"prev_sha256":"2b27efe02ffd2bcb001382f6e30f1922466f967d1c2e33bdd84f0038f1d8537e","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":"crew","thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D01:005","anchor":{"citizen_day":1,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T06:58:00Z"},"kind":"crew_fault","place":"the dip","what":"Closing incident, owned by the lane: segment 4's driver was still running when its state file was read, so the fifth launch spawned him at hp 0.13 / food 0 instead of the hp 6.1 / food 1 the lane believed it had stopped at. A stale-read stop.","evidence":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-20261108.md — 'CLOSING INCIDENT (leads the record, owned)'","sha":"9475bb1a97ad"}],"observations":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"hunger kept ticking in the live world between the read and the kill; the disconnect save recorded the later, worse state"},{"src":"dat_parse","ref":"final save (75.69,64,-105.42) Health 0.1333 foodLevel 0 — the worse state, not the read state"}],"seq":8,"prev_sha256":"df00247fef59153deb903c19607c5fd022f37f47887abc81311ca81f450761b7","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D01:006","anchor":{"citizen_day":1,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T07:05:00Z"},"kind":"day_shape","place":"the home district","what":"Day shape (tension series, evidence only): the series for day 1 is carried at t:D01:series with its gates labelled — food-term pressure nearly throughout; the hp term is flagged an apparatus artefact on days 1-5. The series is not a measure of the day's drama.","evidence":[{"src":"tension","ref":"t:D01:series (this build's tension-series.jsonl)"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"tension/TENSION-IMPL-20261109.md §3 — day 1 row","sha":"99550d681930"}],"observations":[{"src":"tension","ref":"mean T 0.520, peak 0.989 over 1,904 scored seconds (tension-1.0.0)"},{"src":"tension","ref":"top term p_F nearly throughout — the starvation era reads as chronic pressure, correctly in shape"}],"seq":9,"prev_sha256":"75fe3713e8c979124885951aa187a3348090ecb965c10e5f1f25503e9422fa3b","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D02:001","anchor":{"citizen_day":2,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T07:15:20Z"},"kind":"scenario_placed","place":"the pen","what":"The crew staged the set before his wake, declared as a world edit: a fenced pen (ring x61..64 / z-102..-99) stocked with 3 pigs, 2 cows, 2 chickens, and a 6-cell wheat patch by a water trench, all on the home shelf.","evidence":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY2-20261108.md VERDICT — JOB 1 (probe census 07:15:20Z)","sha":"b0f6943ff22a"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY2-20261108.md PRE-FLIGHT — terrain census, pulse/stage-probe-result.json","sha":"b0f6943ff22a"}],"observations":[{"src":"census","ref":"stage-probe census: all 7 animals inside the ring at placement; wheat standing on all 6 farmland cells"},{"src":"trace","ref":"he reached the pen fence from the bowl by his own route (cycles 37-41) — reachability proven in play"}],"seq":10,"prev_sha256":"6a9d7f61a191d4749ae9e3be491a41e8b0e332536f1f722f8776b8a654555ade","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D02:002","anchor":{"citizen_day":2,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T07:30:00Z"},"kind":"first","place":"the pen","what":"First eating of the direct-drive era: he killed a pig at the pen fence at cycle 41 and the floor's auto-eat took food 0 to 3; a chicken at cycle 43 took it to 5, the day's peak. The staged goal of food above 14 was not reached; he drained back to 0.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-2 trace cycles 41/43 (kills), food samples 0 -> 3 -> 5 -> 0","sha":"59b3b53be924"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY2-20261108.md VERDICT — 'DID HE EAT: YES'","sha":"b0f6943ff22a"}],"observations":[{"src":"trace","ref":"food 0 -> 3 -> 5 across cycles 41-43, then a 230-cycle drain to 0"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"three independent stores agree on the eating (driver trace, state file, watch snapshots)"}],"seq":11,"prev_sha256":"097590d721c97d4fdf56fe772e593cee3abc0251db1985fc2ba251645b3a77b3","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":"Pig's down and I've got a porkchop — ate one already, food's up to 3. Two pigs left in the pen, that's my breeding pair, so I leave them be... No — spare the pairs.","motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":"furnace","status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D02:003","anchor":{"citizen_day":2,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T07:31:00Z"},"kind":"thread_open","place":"the pen","what":"At the fence he spared the breeding pair in his own words, then named the furnace as his next want. The furnace thread opens here; it is still open at day 10.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-2 trace cycle 42 (say), cycle 44 (furnace line)","sha":"59b3b53be924"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY2-20261108.md VERDICT — 'HIS JUDGEMENT, verbatim (cycle 42)'","sha":"b0f6943ff22a"}],"observations":[{"src":"trace","ref":"cycle 44, his words: 'I've been eating raw like an animal — let me get a furnace going. I've got cobblestone for it.'"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"his pig count was perception's, not the world's: 3 pigs were staged, 2 already outside the ring's east edge"}],"seq":12,"prev_sha256":"1c9947f30f93f98ed788e5bf3f2d89838a3b4d8398401840854cf4b86505623c","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":"prompt","thread":"pen","status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D02:004","anchor":{"citizen_day":2,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T08:30:00Z"},"kind":"recurrence","place":"the pen","what":"The pen did not survive its citizen: he removed and replaced the gate (cycle 50), dug fence at (61,67,-99), and patched (62,67,-101) with his own cobblestone. By close, zero staged animals stood within 30 blocks of the pen — 2 eaten, the rest dispersed through the breach.","evidence":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY2-20261108.md VERDICT — 'THE PEN AT CLOSE (probe re-read 08:3xZ)' + 'THE PEN'S HALF-LIFE'","sha":"b0f6943ff22a"}],"observations":[{"src":"census","ref":"close probe: ring standing except the (61,-99) gap; gate in place; his cobble patch at (62,-101) stands in the world"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"fault filed in-record: the single-ring diggable stage design (prompt), the citizen's behaviour correct throughout"}],"seq":13,"prev_sha256":"13ec5296c8c5a6c91bf1243abedcc2da4ccef42c30a3c27c8d979d655b03befb","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
