{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D03:001","anchor":{"citizen_day":3,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T08:49:00Z"},"kind":"first","place":"the wheat patch","what":"With structures in his perception and a places-memory seeded from his own day-2 visits, he went straight to the wheat patch and the pen from recollection, with zero searching.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-3 trace cycles 11 (pen from memory), 23 (wheat)","sha":"e5f03ff6d612"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY3-20261108.md — THE BUILD (structures + places-memory) and THE DAY, minutes 0-3","sha":"4c2eaaf99794"}],"observations":[{"src":"trace","ref":"his state text carried the structures line live: 'a fence gate NE of you, 2 blocks (at 64,67,-101); ... a wheat patch (6 farmland, 6 wheat plants, 6 of them RIPE and yellow)'"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"the places seed was written only from day-2 trace encounters, in his own terms"}],"seq":15,"prev_sha256":"fbf3c3f80d6670cb62684c9ffc66bd6929037cc928b97c76fcef8f3872ab7922","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D03:002","anchor":{"citizen_day":3,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T09:47:00Z"},"kind":"first","place":"the pen","what":"The food goal was reached: at cycle 145 the floor ate held porkchops and food stood at 15 (goal 14); the day's peak was 18. It was the first day the eating held for more than minutes.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-3 trace — food samples to 15 at c145, peak 18","sha":"e5f03ff6d612"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY3-20261108.md — 'GOAL (>=14) REACHED c145 (~09:47Z). Peak for the day: 18'","sha":"4c2eaaf99794"}],"observations":[{"src":"trace","ref":"kills at the pen: chicken c11 (food 0->4), chicken c37 (6), pig c78 (9), pig c143-145 (12 -> 15)"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"hp regenerated 0.13 -> 4.13 while fed — the eating mattered mechanically, not just numerically"}],"seq":16,"prev_sha256":"54560dc760dfbf8893991aed81bfffef513ac320f93ec5c74d73bf31e0e8a620","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":"harness","thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D03:003","anchor":{"citizen_day":3,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T08:52:00Z"},"kind":"recurrence","place":"the wheat patch","what":"The first ripe wheat harvest failed in the hand-off: he dug the ripe wheat at cycle 23, the collect verb visited zero drops, and the wheat despawned unheld. A later collect (cycle 102) delivered wheat x1 and seeds x2 — the day's whole harvest.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-3 trace cycles 23 (dig), 102 (collect)","sha":"e5f03ff6d612"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY3-20261108.md — 'c23: first ripe wheat harvested — but collect visited 0 drops'","sha":"4c2eaaf99794"}],"observations":[{"src":"trace","ref":"he claimed held wheat he did not hold ('I have 5 wheat from the farmland' — inventory: 0); at c110 inventory truth reached him: 'I only have 1 w[heat]'"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"~20 digs went into the x=66 water column — the seeded patch-centre coordinate was the trench cell (a crew seed error, corrected day 4)"}],"seq":17,"prev_sha256":"ebd415a850f1727ef25f0f4cde3c4f81673b4947e20bc9bb5f327a715508f96a","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
