{"subject":"cody","narration":"Morning, day four. Bare hands, full belly, and home is east.","motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D04:002","anchor":{"citizen_day":4,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T11:00:00Z"},"kind":"first","place":"respawn country","what":"He woke at respawn country (34.5,64,-94.5), food 20, empty hands, and walked home from recollection — by about cycle 98 he stood at his anchor table. Recollection carried him across country this body had never walked.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-4 trace (pulse/direct-drive-trace.jsonl) — spawn at respawn country, anchor reached ~c98","sha":"9202acb81810"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY4-20261108.md CLOSE — 'DID HE GET HOME: YES'","sha":"bda5cfe8f7d4"}],"observations":[{"src":"trace","ref":"en route: two spider flees and one burrow survived; short hops east along z -94..-97, memory-guided"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"his words at the table: 'that's the table at my side, and home is under my feet.'"}],"seq":26,"prev_sha256":"af20d73a1047ec534876b2a4189603f08cb28f157befc4777f90edd68cc1d2bd","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D04:003","anchor":{"citizen_day":4,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T12:12:00Z"},"kind":"floor_act","place":"the home district","what":"Zero deaths (120 -> 120), proven three ways. The survival floor fired 10 times — spiders at the wake country and around home, one creeper at the pit — and every incident ended in hop-flee-clear, muster, or burrow.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-4 trace: 450 rows, 10 floor-escapes, zero death rows","sha":"9202acb81810"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY4-20261108.md CLOSE — 'DEATHS: 0. Proven three ways'","sha":"bda5cfe8f7d4"}],"observations":[{"src":"world_log","ref":"the server log carries no Cody death line for the window (day record CLOSE)"},{"src":"dat_parse","ref":"final hp 18.33 at close (day record CLOSE)"}],"seq":27,"prev_sha256":"938f771faa7313e53d5f360d75d0a572d828fa3ff4b16c73766d828e4f1471b7","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":"The wheat's already gone from these cells — I must have harvested it before I died.","motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D04:004","anchor":{"citizen_day":4,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T11:30:00Z"},"kind":"first","place":"the wheat patch","what":"The wheat was harvested at the plant cell, not the trench: the day-4 seed named the crop's own cell, he dug the plant there, and held wheat x1 and wheat_seeds x3 at close. He later diagnosed the empty cells himself.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-4 trace — plant-cell dig and held wheat","sha":"9202acb81810"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY4-20261108.md CLOSE — 'WHEAT: HARVESTED'","sha":"bda5cfe8f7d4"}],"observations":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"the plant-cell perception repair (structures line carries each crop cell + age) was a pre-launch fix, proven in play this day"},{"src":"dat_parse","ref":"close inventory (NBT): leaf_litter x2, wheat x1, wheat_seeds x3, dirt x1"}],"seq":28,"prev_sha256":"4b2b41ff07fa10837e8ccb901d08fd6024950e6fb7d9e42f715857e747ce2218","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":"harness","thread":"pit","status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D04:005","anchor":{"citizen_day":4,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T12:12:00Z"},"kind":"recurrence","place":"the pit at home","what":"The day's second half went into his own stone pit at home: about 250 cycles digging for furnace stone and improvising dirt stairs against +2 walls. The final save is in the pit at (65.31,63,-92.52), beside a dirt stair one climb short.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-4 trace — position read (66.3,63,-92.6) held across long stretches","sha":"9202acb81810"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY4-20261108.md CLOSE — 'THE POCKET: NEVER ENTERED... the final save is ground truth: in the pit'","sha":"bda5cfe8f7d4"}],"observations":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"his closing stair stands in the world: dirt placed (64,65,-92) and (64,66,-92)"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"fault filed in-record as harness (perception/targeting) + prompt (he keeps choosing the crown) — see b:D04:006"}],"seq":29,"prev_sha256":"6285c3d1a2c14de8327581751dd13352491f59073101577868f78d929ec7cf4e","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
