{"subject":"cody","narration":"my feet are nailed to this floor","motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":"harness","thread":"pit","status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D05:001","anchor":{"citizen_day":5,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T14:42:28Z"},"kind":"recurrence","place":"the pit at home","what":"Zero net displacement in 446 cycles: he woke in the pit at (65.31,63,-92.52) and ended at (64.3,63,-91.7), 1.4 blocks away, still inside the pit. 52 climb attempts produced zero pillar successes; the one ok-flagged climb was a false success — his feet were already at the reported height.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-5 trace — 29 distinct position readings, all feet-y 62-64.3 inside the pit footprint","sha":"d4771dc83479"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY5-20261108.md — 'THE HEADLINE: the climb never happened'","sha":"96217d8785ee"}],"observations":[{"src":"trace","ref":"55 successful digs and dozens of placements — every verb that changes the world worked; every verb that moves the body failed to move it"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"his own words in chat: 'goto's a dead tongue — it never moves me'"}],"seq":32,"prev_sha256":"833f27a065133f3469556a68412242c35ccd5225aa2405a9bcf2df83f634924a","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
