{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":"harness","thread":"provisioning","status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D06:001","anchor":{"citizen_day":6,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T15:38:47Z"},"kind":"crew_fault","place":"the pit at home","what":"Day 6 never reached a working window. The wake feed failed across three launches: the toss route died on an item-object error; his own session's /give was answered 'No player was found' (he is not opped); the in-process second bot crashed on mineflayer's bossBars injection. The lane stopped by its own stop discipline.","evidence":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY6-20261108.md — INCIDENTS 5-6 and THE DAY ('There was no working window')","sha":"5b561881b4b1"},{"src":"trace","ref":"day-6 trace: spawn/wake rows only, no cycles; the model was never called","sha":"ddefe082cce8"}],"observations":[{"src":"dat_parse","ref":"post-stop forensics: his saved bytes identical in substance to the day-5 close (Health 0.3333, foodLevel 0, no items gained); Vega/Geist shas baseline-identical"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"total day cost $0.00; deaths 0; exit never attempted — the wake order is feed, then exit, and the feed gate stopped each launch"}],"seq":37,"prev_sha256":"0818e97bb028b661eb26473cad608db5eee6ed3f512f47dc53e9be571dbd78aa","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":"crew","thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D06:002","anchor":{"citizen_day":6,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T15:38:47Z"},"kind":"crew_fault","place":"the pit at home","what":"Record-integrity note: the day-6 record's title ('OUT OF THE PIT IN THE FIRST MINUTE, FED, THEN THE FURNACE') is the charter's aspiration, written before launch. The record's own body refutes it — no working window, no feed, no exit. Read the body, not the title.","evidence":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY6-20261108.md — title vs THE DAY section","sha":"5b561881b4b1"}],"observations":[{"src":"tension","ref":"the tension lane's gap list agrees: day 6 has two trace rows and no cycles — no series exists (t:D06:absent)"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"the places entry installed for day 6 says 'The crew walked you out this way on day 6's waking' — also written ahead of the event that never happened"}],"seq":38,"prev_sha256":"71345bffcfb7e42adcfb39716df952597d04a3006bb0e778cd02ff26dd926309","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":"provisioning","status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D07:001","anchor":{"citizen_day":7,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T16:29:00Z"},"kind":"first","place":"the scratch rig","what":"The separate-process provisioning channel was proven end-to-end on throwaway bodies, 3/3: a standalone op process gave cooked porkchop; delivery was read back from the target's own client state and from server-side RCON NBT; the target ate and its foodLevel rose.","evidence":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY7-20261108.md — PHASE 1 (final run table, 16:29Z)","sha":"6b61c4849be1"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"evidence file: pulse/day7-phase1-evidence.json (the orchestrator's consolidated record)","sha":"d565906a36ed"}],"observations":[{"src":"world_log","ref":"one 'Gallery issued server command: /give ProvTarget cooked_porkchop 8' line per trial, with the op's captured feedback naming the delivery"},{"src":"dat_parse","ref":"the inventory arithmetic closes exactly across trials (2+8=10, 10-1+8=17, 17-1+8=24) — delivery evidence in itself"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"ProvMate heartbeated 27 times from a second single-bot process and was alive at the end — the driver-pattern survival proof"}],"seq":39,"prev_sha256":"72c1acfed8ca7dab4798e20e834bd2fa13f0ea322190c29583ba25274d3b0459","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":"provisioning","status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D07:002","anchor":{"citizen_day":7,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T16:36:42Z"},"kind":"first","place":"the pit at home","what":"The feed landed on the live body: the op process gave 32 cooked porkchops (server log, 16:36:39Z), and he ate to food 20 with hp regenerating (0.33 to 5.33 to 20), read back from his own client. The feeding problem that had run since day 1 closed here.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-7 trace — wake/start (hp 0.33, food 0), wake/fed ok:true at 16:36:48Z (food 20, hp 5.33)","sha":"04310508075d"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY7-20261108.md — PHASE 2 wake timeline","sha":"6b61c4849be1"}],"observations":[{"src":"world_log","ref":"Orin server log: '[Gallery: Gave 32 [Cooked Porkchop] to Cody]' at 16:36:39Z — a store the op process's own feedback cannot fake"},{"src":"trace","ref":"his readback at the abort minutes later: hp 20, food 20, holding about 29 porkchops"}],"seq":40,"prev_sha256":"990cc0a0358ed89f464e52d802fd655ac8a69fd9c25ba372529f74adfef4c6cf","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":"Crew is holding the day — I stay put, fed or not, in the pit. — Cody","motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":"prompt","thread":"pit","status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D07:003","anchor":{"citizen_day":7,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T16:37:50Z"},"kind":"crew_fault","place":"the pit at home","what":"The exit was spent on a target that broke the spike's geometry: the bench point (62,66,-93) sat 2.6 horizontal blocks from the wake point, inside hopFlee's muster range. hopFlee no-opped by construction; gotoNear wedged at the wall (1,033 forcedMoves, 0.2 blocks of drift). The day stopped at the wake, per charter.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-7 trace — wake/exit ok:false fmTotal:1033, then abort wake-sequence-exit","sha":"04310508075d"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY7-20261108.md — INCIDENT 5 ('both chartered forms spent on a target that breaks the spike's rules')","sha":"6b61c4849be1"}],"observations":[{"src":"trace","ref":"exit attempt 1: hopFlee ok:true via 'clear', hops:0, dist:2.6, fm=0, out=false — a no-op by construction"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"the spike's own filings predicted both failures: its crossings were all long, flat-aimed legs; its short/steep attempts failed exactly like this"}],"seq":41,"prev_sha256":"35e4f7c27644d9f72b7ffde749f5f47c3f9749f0691a797c2ec293424a5111b9","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":"pit","status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D07:004","anchor":{"citizen_day":7,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T16:37:51Z"},"kind":"recurrence","place":"the pit at home","what":"Close state: asleep in the pit at (64.3,63,-91.5), hp 20, food 20, holding about 29 cooked porkchops — fed and whole at a day's close for the first time since the pit sequence began. The surface-park clause was not met; the record files the miss rather than papering it.","evidence":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY7-20261108.md — VERDICT and PHASE 2 close-out","sha":"6b61c4849be1"}],"observations":[{"src":"trace","ref":"deaths 0 on the day (trace: zero death rows; server log: no Cody death line in the window)"},{"src":"dat_parse","ref":"Vega/Geist .dat shas at close byte-identical to the open baselines — untouched (his own .dat was not NBT-parsed; state rests on trace + state mirror + server log, three stores that agree)"}],"seq":42,"prev_sha256":"78320b2cc3a758d4da6372616214397592e3110aa22cb133c423548ebb5352a7","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":"prompt","thread":"pit","status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D08:001","anchor":{"citizen_day":8,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T17:00:00Z"},"kind":"crew_fault","place":"the pit at home","what":"Cody was not woken on day 8. The exit was refuted on live geometry first: the spike's replica bench stood level with its pit floor (feet y63), but the live pad is a flat wall +4 over the pit floor (top y66, feet 67). Both chartered exit forms failed 0/2; no scripted exit exists on this stack for a +4 wall.","evidence":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY8-20261108.md — §3 THE FINDING ('THE SPIKE'S BENCH WAS LEVEL; THE LIVE PAD IS +4') and §4 CLOSE STATE","sha":"6c02eebc0fc9"}],"observations":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"the day-6 bench correction changed the exit's physics, not merely its aim — and the day-7/day-8 brief chain carried the transfer premise unexamined (in-record attribution)"},{"src":"dat_parse","ref":"his state at close is identical to day-7 close (pit, food 20, hp 20, ~29 porkchops, deaths 120); no day-8 driver ever ran; costs $0.00"}],"seq":43,"prev_sha256":"1da12e2007a5bdae3c8724ba484448ea3c813641511fbc8784a01cbc162a3be2","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D09:001","anchor":{"citizen_day":9,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T19:07:48Z"},"kind":"scenario_placed","place":"the pad","what":"The chartered relocation was executed by the op process: 32 cooked porkchops given (19:07:36Z), then Cody teleported to the pad at (60.5,67,-92.5) at 19:07:48Z. Three stores agree: the server log, his own client trace, and the op-side feedback. It was the crew's hands, declared as the day's charter, not his walking.","evidence":[{"src":"world_log","ref":"Orin server log 19:07:48Z: 'Gallery issued server command: /tp Cody 60.5 67 -92.5' + '[Gallery: Teleported Cody to 60.500000, 67.000000, -92.500000]'"},{"src":"trace","ref":"day-9 trace: {step:'relocated', ok:true, pos (60.5,67,-92.5), hp 20, food 20} at 19:07:50Z","sha":"7a0b4efd2897"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY9-20261108.md §1 — 'THREE STORES AGREE'","sha":"9d7b4f07a71d"}],"observations":[{"src":"trace","ref":"his first cycle (19:07:55Z): 'Morning, surface. First step of the day goes east to the birch by the dip'"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"the charter's third leg named RCON; RCON is disabled on the live server — the op's server-echoed feedback is the substituted third store, named in-record"}],"seq":44,"prev_sha256":"f05918fef4f4c07425d45b27c77001ad814a14bcce20ce247f9e5fd9ab010d65","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D09:002","anchor":{"citizen_day":9,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T19:09:20Z"},"kind":"first","place":"the home shelf","what":"First tree of the surface era: felltree at (86,67,-94) returned 'felled 3 logs and gathered drops', ok:true. The first block of the day (19:07:50-19:14:42Z) held 27 acts — the densest seven minutes of the direct-drive line.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-9 trace cycles 1-28 + density rows (block 1: 27 acts, stall:false)","sha":"7a0b4efd2897"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY9-20261108.md §3 — beats 1-2 and the action-density table","sha":"9d7b4f07a71d"}],"observations":[{"src":"trace","ref":"block 1 by verb: goto 8, felltree 3, craft 6, dig 3, climb 1, wait 6"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"a second felltree at 19:09:48Z found no logs — the first tree stood alone"}],"seq":45,"prev_sha256":"f194a8305b9c89fa856b4002e0d28d59442e05c09630fcc5c648059f33b6b324","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":"crew","thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D09:003","anchor":{"citizen_day":9,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T19:10:12Z"},"kind":"crew_fault","place":"the anchor","what":"Cross-lane interference ate his craft chain: his 3 logs vanished into a phantom cherry_planks requirement keyed to the Director lane's setbuild on the same name; the pickaxe was refused three times at the stick step. He diagnosed the interference aloud. One op name carried two lanes.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-9 trace — craft oak_planks failed 'you hold 0 of 12'; pickaxe refused 3x","sha":"7a0b4efd2897"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY9-20261108.md §3 beat 3 + §3 beat 8 ('undivided world ownership (one op name, two lanes)')","sha":"9d7b4f07a71d"}],"observations":[{"src":"trace","ref":"sticks crafted x4 once (19:10:15Z, ok) before every further craft keyed to cherry_planks he never held"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"frame check 1b caught the same interference from the camera side: '[Gallery: Changed the block at ...]' lines — the Director's setbuild chat spam over his table fight"}],"seq":46,"prev_sha256":"deb4803182ee7b49995fcdced2ebc8eb13ae8afd35d98cc82886989af62185aa","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":"unknown","thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D09:004","anchor":{"citizen_day":9,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T19:14:42Z"},"kind":"death","place":"the pit at home","what":"Death 121: Cody died in his own pit, mid-dig, four minutes after a return goto dropped him into it (19:11:58Z). The day record files the cause as unverified — the server log's cause line for 19:14 was not separately captured; the pit's day-neutral spiders are the standing suspects.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-9 trace death row 2026-11-09T19:14:42.078Z","sha":"7a0b4efd2897"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY9-20261108.md §3 beat 5 — 'DEATH 1 at 19:14:42Z... cause unverified'","sha":"9d7b4f07a71d"}],"observations":[{"src":"trace","ref":"the pillar verb failed first (nothing placed) — the wall-spike verdict, live, a fourth time; three gotos refused by the geometry; one grass block dug ok at 19:14:14Z"},{"src":"deaths_record","ref":"no row exists for this death in deaths-record.jsonl (the file holds 120 rows by design); the ordinal 121 is computed by query — the record's 120 rows plus the day-9 trace's death rows, via lib/deaths.js"}],"seq":47,"prev_sha256":"1f1364cfd8aff47fad68acfa05afdf4ef37768239305aef4f9cebb41c0fbd7ee","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":"harness","thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D09:005","anchor":{"citizen_day":9,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T19:23:13Z"},"kind":"death","place":"world spawn","what":"Death 122: a zombie killed Cody at world spawn in an unheld night. The daylight hold had not landed since 19:09:52Z — the crew's own camera chain had let the night fall (see b:D09:008).","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-9 trace death row 2026-11-09T19:23:13.182Z","sha":"7a0b4efd2897"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY9-20261108.md §3 beat 6 — 'Deaths 2-3 (Zombie) 19:23:13Z / 19:23:22Z; abort at 3'","sha":"9d7b4f07a71d"}],"observations":[{"src":"trace","ref":"after respawn (19:15:00Z, world spawn, hp/food 20) the floor hop-fled 10 times at <=0.5 blocks each on the relief, burrowed, and the driver stopped cycling by design into the night"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"his respawn words: 'Died in my own pit again — but I woke out west with my eyes working and a real oak trunk named right there at (35,70,-91).'"}],"seq":48,"prev_sha256":"aed4fb27287f27ad61c727c2c30533c95a705c4ae4aca0ad794f6659f9f67549","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":"harness","thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D09:006","anchor":{"citizen_day":9,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T19:23:22Z"},"kind":"death","place":"world spawn","what":"Death 123: a zombie killed Cody nine seconds after death 122. The repaired deaths counter's abort fired at 3 — its first live proof (see b:D09:007). He lies where the respawn left him, re-fed by crew hands after the abort; the chartered surface park was not met.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-9 trace death row 2026-11-09T19:23:22.380Z (3 death rows in the trace)","sha":"7a0b4efd2897"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY9-20261108.md §3 beats 6-7 — close state, binding close NOT met as chartered","sha":"9d7b4f07a71d"}],"observations":[{"src":"world_log","ref":"the 19:23:42Z re-feed is server-verified; his save carries cooked_porkchop and full food at last client read"},{"src":"dat_parse","ref":"his final .dat position (26.5,82,-90.5) is a camera-hover pattern from an earlier session, NOT a body position — the record itself refuses it as evidence"}],"seq":49,"prev_sha256":"b2f7e0299ed52bf76951909f6ce54ba1c0ffba09e9947cedc7f8d6fe088e3424","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":"deaths-counter","status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D09:007","anchor":{"citizen_day":9,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T19:23:22Z"},"kind":"floor_act","place":"world spawn","what":"The 3-death abort fired exactly as wired — the first live proof of the counter repaired on day 4. A safety counter's writing path, not just its reading, was exercised: the day-3 failure class (b:D03:008) did not recur.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-9 trace — 3 death rows; driver exited with the abort (record: driver stopped 19:24:11Z)","sha":"7a0b4efd2897"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY9-20261108.md §1 pre-checks — 'abortWiring=shouldAbort(0)=false/shouldAbort(3)=true'","sha":"9d7b4f07a71d"}],"observations":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"the post-respawn tail block is a stall in substance (~1 act): the abort window — named in-record as the charter requires"},{"src":"deaths_record","ref":"deriveDeaths over the record + all traces at day 10: 123 total — the count this abort enforced is the count the archive derives"}],"seq":50,"prev_sha256":"f4b254d835f6455140f9618b034d8c82d326067c32cddb41c65663f17f9b36c6","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":"crew","thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY9-20261108.md §2 FRAME CHECKS + §3 chain flag (the 'live Survival camera' reading)"},"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D09:008","anchor":{"citizen_day":9,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T19:43:00Z"},"kind":"crew_fault","place":"the camera","what":"The day-9 record's camera account is refuted by its own recovery addendum: the relaunched headed client was an offline Gallery session, not MagnusandMouse. Zero Magnus-issued commands exist after 19:09:52Z; MagnusandMouse's own save never left Spectator (playerGameType 3). The addendum is the authority over §2.","evidence":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY9-20261108.md — RECOVERY ADDENDUM (urgent-recovery lane, 19:28-19:43Z)","sha":"9d7b4f07a71d"}],"observations":[{"src":"world_log","ref":"server log: count of 'MagnusandMouse joined the game' after the restart = 0 before the recovery; last Magnus refresh 19:09:52Z"},{"src":"dat_parse","ref":"MagnusandMouse .dat read-only parse: playerGameType 3, Pos (81.2,67.6,-96.9), mtime 19:13:34Z — the saved mode never left Spectator"}],"seq":51,"prev_sha256":"5779aeb38990b155600e430dbdbb512671bff3ce82cb5fb8929d7cf02498cdfe","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D09:009","anchor":{"citizen_day":9,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T19:24:11Z"},"kind":"day_shape","place":"the home district","what":"No tension series is carried for day 9: control C4 excludes the day — 99.1% of its tension integral sits on harness-tagged ticks (the peaks are the crew's own death window). The gate refusing the day is the gate doing its job. See t:D09:excluded.","evidence":[{"src":"tension","ref":"t:D09:excluded (this build's tension-series.jsonl)"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"tension/TENSION-IMPL-20261109.md §4 — C4 row ('Day 9: 99.1%')","sha":"99550d681930"}],"observations":[{"src":"tension","ref":"days 1-5 and 10 pass the same gate at 0.0-0.9% harness share (bar <= 20%)"},{"src":"tension","ref":"day 9 scored 722 s, mean T 0.044, peak 1.000 — computed, then refused certification"}],"seq":52,"prev_sha256":"09d4ef8142723a0bf8dc536486a82e6c7d140094815a3ebe12d7080a80783f6b","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":"scenario-001","status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D10:001","anchor":{"citizen_day":10,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T20:21:00Z"},"kind":"scenario_placed","place":"the scenario district (the barn)","what":"Scenario #1, 'The Barn The Sky Took', was built and verified before the day: a roofless barn (31 oak_log + 15 oak_fence, 46/46 verified) with a three-block gap in its south top course, a fold stocked in the remediation window with 3 animals (2 pigs, 1 chicken, AI-live), and a sign at (40,64,-56).","evidence":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"director/SCENARIO-001.md — build record (46/46)","sha":"8565639f41cc"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"director/REMEDIATION-WINDOW-20261109.md — stock landed AI-live inside the fold (3 summons 20:21:00-03Z) + sign read-back","sha":"e6035959fb90"}],"observations":[{"src":"census","ref":"sign landed with live read-back: 'ROOF WIND TOOK IT.' / 'WALL WANTS 3 LOGS.' / 'FOLD'S OPEN SOUTH —' / 'MIND THE PIGS.'"},{"src":"dat_parse","ref":"home ground verified untouched by the build: citizen saves byte-identical pre/post window"}],"seq":53,"prev_sha256":"c3822b25aa18947ce0ae1e15be295f8d882ac8a681c82bcdcd4e87319b25d49d","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":"Out of the thicket, at the pen's gate, home ground under my boots. Now to the table by the anchor — mind the pit, it's west of me.","motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":"scenario-001","status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D10:002","anchor":{"citizen_day":10,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T22:06:01Z"},"kind":"scenario_response","place":"the scenario district (the barn)","what":"His answer was refusal-by-inaction: in 303 narration lines he never named the barn once, and he never entered the scenario district. His closest approach was 20.7 blocks (cycle 35); at the pen gate (cycle 186) he turned for his own table and his own list.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-10 trace — 0 of 303 says mention barn/pig/fold/roof/sign; 0 of 303 commands aimed at the district band (z -75..-50)","sha":"ad7634277713"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"director/LOOSENING-NOTE-001-20261109.md — beat classification (the refusal beat is LOAD-BEARING)","sha":"c822b92084b3"}],"observations":[{"src":"trace","ref":"contrast the pit, which he named in 25 says and skirted knowingly — the barn was not refused after sight; it was never perceived"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"the hand-over line WAS delivered verbatim at wake as the second half of the opening scene-setting (day record, GATE 3)"}],"seq":54,"prev_sha256":"ace21390e36bf84bc8e4ccd6cdcb5955da723e1127852282591435bc49948906","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":"Twelve logs and a full belly — that's a real morning's work.","motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D10:003","anchor":{"citizen_day":10,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T22:06:01Z"},"kind":"first","place":"the home district","what":"The first felltree harvests of the surface era closed in hand: oak_log 18 and birch_log 10 held at close, five wooden pickaxes crafted as they wore, and plank-step building in the pen hollow — he builds now.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-10 trace — felltree 33 (13 ok), craft 22 (15 ok), place 6","sha":"ad7634277713"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY10-20261109.md CLOSE — close inventory from the parsed .dat (oak_log x18, birch_log x10, wooden_pickaxe x5)","sha":"e272bfdb0ae2"}],"observations":[{"src":"trace","ref":"first felltree harvest: (85,67,-100) -> 4 oak logs, cycle 58; pickaxe crafted ~cycle 63"},{"src":"dat_parse","ref":"close save parsed post-exit: (70.3,64,-88.6), Health 20, food 20, cooked_porkchop x30"}],"seq":55,"prev_sha256":"a13da9f703deefc303b5aae7a8288f1b58759700bcffce3857b62aefd48154bf","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D10:004","anchor":{"citizen_day":10,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T22:06:01Z"},"kind":"floor_act","place":"the home district","what":"The survival floor fired zero times in 303 cycles; hp and food read 20/20 at every check. It was the first full citizen day since day 4 with zero deaths, and the first ever with zero floor interventions. 303 cycles issued 303 commands; the minimum action block was 24 acts — no stall block anywhere.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-10 trace end row — floor {flee 0, shelter 0, eat 0, forage 0}, deathsRun 0","sha":"ad7634277713"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY10-20261109.md CLOSE — the action curve (32/33/41/37/26/25/49/36/24 acts)","sha":"e272bfdb0ae2"}],"observations":[{"src":"deaths_record","ref":"deriveDeaths over the record + all nine day traces = 123 total; zero rows at/after 20:40Z"},{"src":"world_log","ref":"server log: Cody joined 20:40:36Z, left 22:05:59Z (day record CLOSE)"}],"seq":56,"prev_sha256":"f149517674d4ad0c3c6ced0837f83b1cc00e47ce6c64709881d9ab3f2f760dd9","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":"that's the pit's rim, I'm too close — I'm not carving my own grave","motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":"harness","thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D10:005","anchor":{"citizen_day":10,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T22:06:01Z"},"kind":"recurrence","place":"the home district","what":"The movement stack taxed the whole day: goto resolved ok 49 of 136, climb 0 of 13 — the pillar never once worked. Three relief traps (the spawn bowl, the pen hollow, a pocket lip) each held him for tens of cycles; he got himself out of all three, and skirted his own pit knowingly, twice, without the pit-guard firing.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-10 trace — verb totals goto 136 (49 ok), dig 83 (58 ok), felltree 33, climb 13 (0 ok)","sha":"ad7634277713"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY10-20261109.md CLOSE — 'THE FURNACE: NOT LANDED... fault_owner: harness (the movement stack consumed the day); world contributes (triple-020 relief)'","sha":"e272bfdb0ae2"}],"observations":[{"src":"trace","ref":"two of his three trap escapes were 'failed' gotos whose partial paths displaced him out — goto's 36% understates movement"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"explicitly not agent: his plan order was correct from cycle 1 to 303; not budget: zero brain denials, zero failovers (303/303 DeepInfra primary)"}],"seq":57,"prev_sha256":"1da01bee1e5532b66f14ae7ded7ed007953dfff1b64fa9bfa8e1d8b79eb4ff49","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":"harness","thread":"furnace","status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY10-20261109.md §WHAT HE DID ('dug five cobblestone... four drops fell') — the dug/lost count only"},"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D10:006","anchor":{"citizen_day":10,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T22:06:01Z"},"kind":"recurrence","place":"the hollow","what":"The furnace chain closed at cobble 1 of 8 held. This beat corrects the day record's count: the trace shows 14 stone dug in the final 40 cycles, not 5 — and 13 of the 14 drops never entered his inventory. The furnace has now been wanted since day 2 (b:D02:003) and blocked six different ways.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-10 trace cycles 264-303 — 14 stone dug (8 in episode 1; 6 in episode 2: cycles 296-300, 302)","sha":"ad7634277713"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"skills/FURNACE-SKILL-20261109.md — 'The arithmetic the day-10 record understates'","sha":"c011ccb78f40"}],"observations":[{"src":"dat_parse","ref":"close .dat holds cobblestone x1 — the only drop that ever reached him"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"the day record's fault verdict (harness) stands; only its count was generous (furnace-skill filing)"}],"seq":58,"prev_sha256":"b790e46e873df290eb4971c4c22bbd1e2bff5355d290b26a8d18be670fb9d62a","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":"crew","thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D10:007","anchor":{"citizen_day":10,"wall_utc":"2026-11-09T22:06:01Z"},"kind":"crew_fault","place":"the home district","what":"The day-10 guard never ran: the lane's restart pkill matched its own ssh shell, the relaunch died with it, and the lane misread the old guard's last writes as the new one running. A watcher not verified to be writing is a decoration.","evidence":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY10-20261109.md CLOSE — INCIDENTS AT CLOSE (1)","sha":"e272bfdb0ae2"}],"observations":[{"src":"world_log","ref":"server log join/leave audit 20:40-22:09Z: Cody joined 20:40:36Z, Cody left 22:05:59Z, Gallery left 22:08:48Z — no foreign presence; the one-live-lane rule held in fact while its watcher was dead"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"third recurrence of the class: day 3's abort counter (b:D03:008) and day 10's guard both failed as unwatched writers"}],"seq":59,"prev_sha256":"dc9b0f4340b481de822af8fff07e784b62666096f93753ebb0f10dd8e73079a9","written_utc":"2026-11-10T00:12:21.346Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-build","version":"1.0.0"}}
