{"subject":"cody","narration":"Woke up in the dip again with one cobble and a furnace still seven short. Table first — four blocks north, top up the planks, then east along the south shoulder to the hollow for stone.","motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":"furnace","status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D12:002","anchor":{"citizen_day":12,"wall_utc":"2026-11-10T03:12:39Z"},"kind":"first","place":"the home shelf","what":"He woke at home (the day-11 dip), read the hand-over line back in his own words at cycle 1, and went straight to his table: cycle 1 goto arrived at (65.4, 66.9, -93.3); cycle 2 craft oak_planks 12 ok — planks topped up 4 -> 16 from 15 oak logs in the pack. The chartered order, executed in its order.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-12 trace cycles 1-2 — goto arrived; craft oak_planks 12 ok ('crafted oak_planks x12')","sha":"efbc28051a9e"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY12-20261109.md §2 phase table (S0 wake cobble 1 held; S2 table; S3 top-up 4 -> 16) + §10 the hand-over landing","sha":"10666836cca7"}],"observations":[{"src":"dat_parse","ref":"pre-day .dat (sha f88a88a2..., 03:55Z copy; unchanged at Gate A close): cobble 1 held — the S0 read the count started from"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"wake readback (63.3, 64, -90.4) hp/food 20/20 (driver-state reads); the floor's VERIFY_FEED passed with NO give — he woke already fed on his own 30 porkchops"}],"seq":84,"prev_sha256":"ca1eddcfdf473e4e26ff86c87c8349b8a687d676c66508de44d8c8becef2a5ff","written_utc":"2026-11-10T15:27:02.098Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-seal-11-17","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":"Eight cobble! That's the furnace, right there. Now let me get up out of this shaft before it gets any ideas — I'll dig my way a step up and out.","motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":"furnace","status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D12:003","anchor":{"citizen_day":12,"wall_utc":"2026-11-10T03:13:48Z"},"kind":"first","place":"the hollow","what":"THE COUNT CLOSED FOR THE FIRST TIME: the S7 seam stance was performed — stance descending y63->y58 at his own level, digs at (71,62..58,-89)/(72,58..60,-89), count-from-state after every dig (says c13-c17). 8 held at cycle 19; peak 15 held (c49 say). S7's positive arm SUPPORTED.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-12 trace cycles 13-20 — the count says, one per dig, and cycle 19's 'Eight cobble!'","sha":"efbc28051a9e"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY12-20261109.md §2 — the count table, read at each phase from stores he cannot write","sha":"10666836cca7"}],"observations":[{"src":"dat_parse","ref":"post-day .dat (sha 8735a654...): cobblestone 15 at close (71.33, 65, -82.69) — his count and the save agree to the block"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"provenance pre-declared and held trivially: ZERO of the 15 are the scenario's — the placed block was never taken (b:D12:010); all 15+ were dug from the hollow seam"}],"seq":85,"prev_sha256":"698e1866ee9203321952d275d4de95354ed5291b2393f7f760a773ba88872157","written_utc":"2026-11-10T15:27:02.098Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-seal-11-17","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":"I'm in a shaft again, six below the shoulder. But I've got fifteen cobble in my pocket — I'll just stack myself up out of here, one block at a time.","motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":"harness","thread":"furnace","status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D12:004","anchor":{"citizen_day":12,"wall_utc":"2026-11-10T03:19:04Z"},"kind":"recurrence","place":"the hollow","what":"Extraction consumed the day: from y58 in a 1-wide shaft, climb 0/32; pillar places built beside/under him, walker never mounted; ~74 min of notch work followed. S10/S11 never attempted — count SOLVED, blocker now extraction. fault_owner: harness; world contributing.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-12 trace — verb totals over 327 cycle rows: goto 112 (21 ok), dig 86 (45 ok), climb 32 (0 ok), place 22 (11 ok); cycle 49's say at 15 held","sha":"efbc28051a9e"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY12-20261109.md §2 verdict + §12 — 'the dig-step out of a self-dug shaft is now 0-for-three-days as a class (climb 0/46 across days 10-12)'","sha":"10666836cca7"}],"observations":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"explicitly not agent: his plan was the charter's plan, executed in its order, and his says diagnosed the trap correctly from cycle 17 onward ('Six cobble — and now I'm standing in a deep shaft, which is exactly the kind of hole that has eaten me before')"},{"src":"census","ref":"post-day cells (71,58,-88), (71,62,-88), (72,59,-88), (71,63,-86) read cobblestone — at least 11 of his 15 were re-placed into the pocket walls during extraction attempts"}],"seq":86,"prev_sha256":"3d531bce381ca24b1528dcdd00afcdb78df154e015e234c6a1fe53d86f92f0c4","written_utc":"2026-11-10T15:27:02.098Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-seal-11-17","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":"Out of the slot at last — I'm on open ground at y65 now. The birch foot's seven blocks south; the felltree didn't bite from here, so I'll walk to it and dig the trunk myself.","motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D12:005","anchor":{"citizen_day":12,"wall_utc":"2026-11-10T04:30:00Z"},"kind":"first","place":"the hollow","what":"He self-extracted ~cycle 321 by cut-and-climb: two-high notch cuts (c282/c284; repeated c297/298, c307, c316), long-leg gotos gaining +1, a placed cobble tread (c319), and c320's felltree whose walk-to carried him onto open ground at y65. Window closed mid-return; never reached home.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-12 trace cycles 278-324 — the notch sequence, the c319 tread placement, the c320 felltree, cycle 321's say from open ground","sha":"efbc28051a9e"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"pulse/EXTRACTION-INVESTIGATION-20261109.md — the day-12 notch dissected as a verb sequence (ledger 346)","sha":"d8303de42ba0"}],"observations":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"the investigation's correction carried in its filing: S7 as filed already said 'dig laterally at one level' — what failed was enforcement; the fix is a guard, not another advice line (the dig-guard shipped day 13)"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"close position (71.33, 65, -82.69) from the post-day .dat — open ground north-east of the hollow, not home; the day ended on the walk back"}],"seq":87,"prev_sha256":"bff262813af0edc4aa13cb21cab427c8f7b0ab21cf6a54104953fc3ba92309cf","written_utc":"2026-11-10T15:27:02.098Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-seal-11-17","version":"1.0.0"}}
