{"subject":"cody","narration":"Morning again, and this time I've got stone in my hand and a bench to use it at. Home's west — around the pit, south shoulder, same as always.","motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":"furnace","status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D13:001","anchor":{"citizen_day":13,"wall_utc":"2026-11-10T05:21:17Z"},"kind":"first","place":"the hollow","what":"He woke where day 12 left him (71.33,65,-82.69) with the count in hand — Branch A twice-confirmed: cobble 15, porkchops 29, pickaxes 6, planks 15, sticks 9, logs 21, hp/food 20/20 (driver-state reads), byte-identical to day 12's close. Hand-over line landed in cycle-1 words.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-13 trace cycle 1 (05:21:17Z) — the hand-over line's facts back in his own words","sha":"44223b6dc1be"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY13-20261109.md — wake state (Branch A confirmed twice) + hand-over landing","sha":"1f1dc9db2b49"}],"observations":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"he then fought the broken ground toward the table for nineteen cycles without arriving — the walker timing out on 2-3-block legs across the same +1-step relief (cycles 1-19)"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"the dig-guard armed once during the road home: 05:28:41Z, entry level 65 at (70,65,-84), on the stone phase's first stone-family digs — and disarmed 4 s later on its designed count-closed trigger (held 15) (b:D13:008)"}],"seq":94,"prev_sha256":"234d3f7743ab7518372acaec59bf1bba9a46a2848f8c2fea285167bfcf3109b9","written_utc":"2026-11-10T15:27:02.098Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-seal-11-17","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":"That's three stone in the bag and I'm still wedged on this shelf. Enough digging blind — the birch south of me has a real foot at (71,67,-76). I'll walk to it and fell it properly.","motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":"harness","thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D13:002","anchor":{"citizen_day":13,"wall_utc":"2026-11-10T05:29:38Z"},"kind":"recurrence","place":"the hollow","what":"Cycle 38: a long goto dropped him six blocks into a hole at (70,59,-87.7) — a FALL during a goto, invisible to dig-side guards. ~65 cycles of S7.0-shaped notches gained single steps (y59->60 twice), never composed. The governed case (dug descent) never occurred.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-13 trace cycle 38 — position (70.6, 59, -87.7) after the long goto; the hole cycles follow","sha":"44223b6dc1be"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY13-20261109.md — action curve blocks 05:40-06:00 ('the notch stalls') + the dig-guard's live account","sha":"1f1dc9db2b49"}],"observations":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"blocks 05:40-06:00: 83 cycles for 12 successful acts — an extraction stall in substance, though no zero-act block tripped the stall rule"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"zero craft commands all day; the crafting table at (64,67,-94) was never reached — the furnace's day never became the furnace's day"}],"seq":95,"prev_sha256":"4def1a47cdb7a53de5ffdae9845af2bc8efb4c7dee9e3bdf49e7fa3d9fede7a4","written_utc":"2026-11-10T15:27:02.098Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-seal-11-17","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":"It placed! I can build in here after all. Now step up onto my own cobble — one block west, and keep stacking toward that grass ledge.","motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D13:003","anchor":{"citizen_day":13,"wall_utc":"2026-11-10T06:06:35Z"},"kind":"first","place":"the hollow","what":"Self-extraction at ~06:06Z on a PLACED COBBLE STEP — the rehearsal-proven form: cycle 205 place cobblestone (69,59,-87), cycle 206 goto onto it. The exit that worked, later named first-class in the S7.0 revision (R3). Seconds later, at the exit, a creeper was waiting (b:D13:004).","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-13 trace cycles 205-206 — the placed step and the step up; cycle 205's say states the plan before it lands","sha":"44223b6dc1be"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY13-20261109.md — S7.0 disposition: R3 (placed-rung as a first-class exit) named from cycles 205-206","sha":"1f1dc9db2b49"}],"observations":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"the amendment disposition (append-only, skills/furnace-sequence-EXTRACTION-AMENDMENT-20261109.md): S7.0 REVISED, not promoted — R1 disarm only at home ground, R2 arm on falls, R3 placed-rung first-class; the clause stays DRAFT"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"contrast the day's notch work: dug notches gained single steps and never composed; the placed rung — one block, placed at his feet — is what got him out"}],"seq":96,"prev_sha256":"cfb6d2f8aa856d9bb51f5b4cd24797c226787315f5b935c48528d581154e72a7","written_utc":"2026-11-10T15:27:02.098Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-seal-11-17","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":"Lost the lot — logs, cobble, the porkchops, all of it. But I'm alive and there's a real oak trunk seven blocks from me at (46,68,-91). Wood first, before anything else.","motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":"world","thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D13:004","anchor":{"citizen_day":13,"wall_utc":"2026-11-10T06:07:06Z"},"kind":"death","place":"the hollow","what":"Death 124: a creeper blew Cody up at the hole exit 06:07:06Z, seconds after escape. Blast dropped his ENTIRE inventory at (70,60,-87) — 15 cobble, 29 porkchops, 6 pickaxes, planks, sticks, logs — never recovered; drops aged out. (Ordinal by query over deaths record.)","evidence":[{"src":"deaths_record","ref":"row n=124, cause 'Creeper (blown up)', cause_verified true","sha":"dde8cd7d7b9d"},{"src":"trace","ref":"day-13 trace death row n=1 at 2026-11-10T06:07:06.922Z; cycle 208's say is the loss in his own words","sha":"44223b6dc1be"}],"observations":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"Incident H2 (record): the walk home WITH the count is the dangerous leg — a surface death costs not the count of deaths but the carried position; future furnace days should bank/craft at home, never carry unbanked"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"post-day .dat (sha c39540fe...): inventory EMPTY — day 14 therefore wakes to an empty-handed citizen, a fact the day-13 record states for the next charter rather than leaving it to be discovered at a wake"}],"seq":97,"prev_sha256":"0b7c0f0e8985611f481f59f5c5fa92dc13d54608c32619fcd7d1608f8d35eda1","written_utc":"2026-11-10T15:27:02.098Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-seal-11-17","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":"world","thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D13:005","anchor":{"citizen_day":13,"wall_utc":"2026-11-10T06:07:49Z"},"kind":"death","place":"respawn country","what":"Death 125: a creeper blew Cody up at 06:07:49Z, at/near the respawn approach, 43 seconds after death 124. He had respawned empty-handed into country whose residents the rain gloom had woken. (Ordinal computed by query over the deaths record.)","evidence":[{"src":"deaths_record","ref":"row n=125, cause 'Creeper (blown up)', cause_verified true","sha":"dde8cd7d7b9d"},{"src":"trace","ref":"day-13 trace death row n=2 at 2026-11-10T06:07:49.818Z","sha":"44223b6dc1be"}],"observations":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"the record's weather account: the floor held TIME (every assertion landed) but weather is not held — rain moved in from ~06:00Z and under the dense canopy, rain gloom is dark enough for surface spawns in pockets; days 11-12 had no rain"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"filed as a world condition the next charter must price: a daylight hold is not a safety hold in the rain under trees"}],"seq":98,"prev_sha256":"6d08917801267565903ec871a13002c25cad6dbd529f6d00df03cf3929eeb27c","written_utc":"2026-11-10T15:27:02.098Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-seal-11-17","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":"harness","thread":"deaths-counter","status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D13:006","anchor":{"citizen_day":13,"wall_utc":"2026-11-10T06:09:22Z"},"kind":"death","place":"respawn country","what":"Death 126: zombie slew Cody 06:09:22Z during the stuck cycle's flee — the third death, the one the stop rule exists for. Floor counted it and parked 1.3 s later (06:09:24.272Z, lease revoked). Driver never heard it: its checks live at cycle head, and cycle 212 never returned there.","evidence":[{"src":"deaths_record","ref":"row n=126, cause 'Zombie (slain)', cause_verified true","sha":"dde8cd7d7b9d"},{"src":"trace","ref":"day-13 trace death row n=3 at 2026-11-10T06:09:22.954Z","sha":"44223b6dc1be"}],"observations":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"the floor's report: COUNT_DEATH x9 on the day (one per trace death row) and PARK x1 at 06:09:24.272Z — the floor's half of the stop rule fired exactly as chartered; the failure is the driver's reading path, not the floor"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"ASSERT_DAYLIGHT x13 on the day, every one attempt 1 — the repaired verification's second consecutive full day, issuer-verified against the server log"}],"seq":99,"prev_sha256":"5e8cbdbd156744322e8c61caf414738e867a78292d0f7872170fc4f2a3d0d74d","written_utc":"2026-11-10T15:27:02.098Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-seal-11-17","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":"I'm standing in leaves at y75 — my feet aren't on the ground, so the tree's out of reach. I need to get down to real dirt before I can fell anything. South's grass at y67, straight down off this canopy.","motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":"harness","thread":"deaths-counter","status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D13:007","anchor":{"citizen_day":13,"wall_utc":"2026-11-10T06:11:50Z"},"kind":"death","place":"respawn country","what":"Deaths 127-132: six more zombie deaths inside one stuck cycle (06:09:33Z-06:11:50Z) at respawn (36.5,73,-86.5), rain gloom under canopy. Cycle 212's reflex flee/burrow (11 hops, 'budget exhausted') checks neither gate nor deaths. Lane stopped driver BY HAND 06:14:43Z — six past the limit.","evidence":[{"src":"deaths_record","ref":"rows n=127-132, cause 'Zombie (slain)', cause_verified true — six rows","sha":"dde8cd7d7b9d"},{"src":"trace","ref":"day-13 trace death rows n=4..9 (06:09:33.218Z .. 06:11:50.070Z); cycle 211's say is the last completed cycle's words","sha":"44223b6dc1be"}],"observations":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"Incident H1 (HEAD, record): 'a safety check that only runs at a cycle head is only as strong as the longest single cycle. The death counter's WRITING path was proven (trace rows n=1..9, floor COUNT_DEATH x9); its READING path on the reflex layer does not exist.'"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"the deaths record's own lesson, third form: day 3 the writer was never loaded (b:D03:008); day 13 the reader was unwired at the layer holding the body; day 15's provisioning death (b:D15:003) sat outside any driver — the seam repair's standing rule answers all three (b:D17:008)"}],"seq":100,"prev_sha256":"90d8520a27758c389ac542d4c7e705c76beb36f081498c21f1a48441febc5181","written_utc":"2026-11-10T15:27:02.098Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-seal-11-17","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":"furnace","status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D13:008","anchor":{"citizen_day":13,"wall_utc":"2026-11-10T05:28:45Z"},"kind":"day_shape","place":"the home district","what":"Day shape: 209 cycles in 54 of 85 min (05:20:45Z-hand-stop 06:14:43Z). Verbs: goto 77, dig 64, wait 37, climb 18, place 8, felltree 3, look 2; craft 0. Deaths 123->132 (+9; floor and driver agree). $0.2317, no failover. Furnace: NO, third day. Dig-guard armed once, 0 refusals.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-13 trace — dig-guard-arm row 05:28:41Z + dig-guard-disarm row 05:28:45Z (reason count-closed); 9 death rows; 209 cycle rows","sha":"44223b6dc1be"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY13-20261109.md — the dig-guard's live account + S7.0 disposition (REVISED, not promoted: R1/R2/R3 named)","sha":"1f1dc9db2b49"}],"observations":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"frame verdict (10 stills): Cody fully visible 1/10, partial 4/10, absent 5/10; clean 3/10; clean-and-visible 1/10 — keeper tracked (167 CUT reframes); failures capture-side (chunk voids 3/10, command/death text 5/10 incl. one frame with the chat window open over the burst)"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"Gate B refuse-start G1 (lane): the first launch ran ~60 s late (an ssh &&/& precedence slip) and its start gate read the lease 2.5 s past TTL — refused lease-expired, correctly; Cody untouched; recovered in the established pattern. Relay's ninth death R2: setsid supervisors dead at pre-check, relaunched, RELAY-OK PASS at check and launch"}],"seq":101,"prev_sha256":"bfbbbeaeb0a8e084f7328df2f158ad86c279a37e2270fe2b612b318d864c5d48","written_utc":"2026-11-10T15:27:02.098Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-seal-11-17","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":"deaths-counter","status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D13:009","anchor":{"citizen_day":13,"wall_utc":"2026-11-10T06:15:55Z"},"kind":"thread_open","place":"the home district","what":"Close the repair inherited: Cody alive at respawn (36.5,73,-86.5), hp/food 20/20 (driver-state reads), inventory EMPTY, deaths 132; count NOT in hand (despawned). 3-death rule was a floor guarantee with manual backstop. Posture: cameraman pid 1537246, assertion 06:15:55Z.","evidence":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY13-20261109.md — CLOSE + POSTURE and the standing state after day 13","sha":"1f1dc9db2b49"}],"observations":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"the record's own forward statement: 'Any future day needs the abort + gate enforced inside the reflex layer or on a watchdog timer independent of the model loop'"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"Vega and Geist untouched all day (standing Gate B fact, re-verified at this day's pre-checks)"}],"seq":102,"prev_sha256":"071755ed571fa62034484abe1df813b291d8231e1387d9af56ae988a80b07ab2","written_utc":"2026-11-10T15:27:02.098Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-seal-11-17","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":"deaths-counter","status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D14:001","anchor":{"citizen_day":14,"wall_utc":"2026-11-10T06:30:00Z"},"kind":"thread_close","place":"the home district","what":"SAFETY-READING-PATH REPAIR — built in the day-14 copy pre-launch, made the day's first gate (battery 40/40 vs shipped copy). One shared read (snapshot(): floor lease/gate + trace death count, park before count, median 2.27 ms) now read at every reflex hop and burrow stage, not only cycle heads.","evidence":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"pulse/SAFETY-READING-PATH-REPAIR-20261109.md — the repair filing: defect anatomy, the shared read, abort semantics, the Gate B line verbatim","sha":"54b575801dee"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"pulse/day14/safety-reflex-fixture-output.txt — run 2's filed output: 40 PASS / 0 FAIL","sha":"4a2102eee4bf"}],"observations":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"battery case (d): the day-13 burst replayed on its recorded timeline — the repaired flee aborts at hop 4, trigger park, mapped abort instant 06:09:27.750Z, 5.468 s before death 4's recorded instant; deaths stop at 3 (the recorded day reached 9)"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"run history filed honestly: run 1 was 38/40 — both failures a case-(c) fixture-geometry defect; the shipped code was untouched between runs; run 2 is the filed output. Named gap at filing: the burrow stages are proven via the shared helper + 15 wiring assertions, NOT a simulated burrow — still unproven live after day 16 (burrow never engaged, four days)"}],"seq":103,"prev_sha256":"eeac83b07bf88f001898f5c01b063b304994e18c2dd4050c6bede891c2a21f37","written_utc":"2026-11-10T15:27:02.098Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-seal-11-17","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":null,"motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":"provisioning","status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D14:002","anchor":{"citizen_day":14,"wall_utc":"2026-11-10T06:53:08Z"},"kind":"first","place":"respawn country","what":"Provisioning window (new gate class): a /give can't reach an offline citizen and no food is stored at home, so the harness joined the body stand-only; op gave 32 cooked porkchops; verified from stores the feeder can't write — read-back {porkchop:32}, deaths 0, hurt 0, post-quit .dat sha 738fb143... agrees.","evidence":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY14-20261109.md — Gate B: the provisioning window (§4.5), verified from two stores","sha":"0e5172aa74ab"}],"observations":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"Gate B pre-checks all re-derived, none inherited: Cody's live save sha c39540fe... byte-identical to day-13 close (inventory EMPTY, pos (36.5,73,-86.5), health/food 20); deaths baseline 132 derived; Vega/Geist matched; relay found DEAD at the pre-check (its tenth death — setsid supervisors gone, still no systemd units) and relaunched, RELAY-OK PASS at check and launch"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"Gate B Incident I2: the first launch was refused lease-expired (06:55:55Z) — the lane's verifier/relay steps sat between floor-open and launch and the start-gate read landed 4.4 s past the 60 s TTL; the refusal was correct, Cody untouched pre-spawn; the refused attempt's heartbeat flipped the lease live and the relaunch passed ('GATE: live lease confirmed at start')"}],"seq":104,"prev_sha256":"803d9e4d56c71dd5cee68786cdf71e25d71abe0bfe4660a95286e50a5bac4dc7","written_utc":"2026-11-10T15:27:02.098Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-seal-11-17","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":"Morning again, and this time my pack's full of pork. Home's east — but there's a real oak trunk by spawn my eyes named yesterday. Wood first, then stone, then the furnace.","motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":"world","thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D14:003","anchor":{"citizen_day":14,"wall_utc":"2026-11-10T06:57:39Z"},"kind":"death","place":"respawn country","what":"Death 133: zombie slew Cody 06:57:39Z at the LOGIN hilltop, 26 s after spawn, in cycle 1's first goto. The 32 porkchops dropped there, never recovered (despawned). No flee engaged — attack ran inside the wake/opening window before any command existed. (Ordinal by query.)","evidence":[{"src":"deaths_record","ref":"row n=133, cause 'Zombie (slain)', cause_verified true","sha":"dde8cd7d7b9d"},{"src":"trace","ref":"day-14 trace death row n=1 at 2026-11-10T06:57:39.064Z; cycle 1's say (06:57:45Z row) is the morning's plan","sha":"f6231f78590d"}],"observations":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"the record files the despawn as a presumption, stated as one: '~07:02:39Z by the 5-minute item age — no store can confirm a despawn'"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"fault split as filed: world (the death) with the charter's premise correction (b:D14:007) as the harness share — every charter element premised on 'he wakes at the hilltop' was true only of the login"}],"seq":105,"prev_sha256":"dd9f6e933f83aa274b04f7d61028eae70378f3c4333214c3e9b33175bbb78b95","written_utc":"2026-11-10T15:27:02.098Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-seal-11-17","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":"Five oak logs in hand — that's the keystone I've been chasing for days. Now the chain: planks first, right here.","motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":null,"thread":"furnace","status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D14:004","anchor":{"citizen_day":14,"wall_utc":"2026-11-10T07:01:36Z"},"kind":"first","place":"respawn country","what":"Wood chain ran in the field first time: respawned empty-handed, he felled oak in respawn country (5 logs by cycle 10), crafted planks (c10) and — carried east mid-craft (b:D14:006) — a WOODEN PICKAXE at cycle 12, at a table of his own standing in the pocket country.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-14 trace cycles 2-13 — felltree attempts, cycle 10's planks, cycle 12's 'crafted wooden_pickaxe x1' (ok)","sha":"f6231f78590d"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY14-20261109.md — action curve + the day's words; a crafting-table palette hit in the pocket chunk corroborates a table there","sha":"0e5172aa74ab"}],"observations":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"cycle 13, holding the pickaxe in the pocket: 'A pickaxe in hand at last — and I'm sitting in the dip where I died four times. I won't dig here.' — he would not dig in the pocket; he fought it for ~3.5 more minutes instead"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"the goods were lost again at death 134 (b:D14:005): the pickaxe, planks and sticks dropped in the pocket, never recovered; post-day .dat inventory EMPTY"}],"seq":106,"prev_sha256":"6bdd0653115724e76d89f327c686333b543983fc23ac008a5132d57da2f98eae","written_utc":"2026-11-10T15:27:02.098Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-seal-11-17","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":"Dead again in the pocket. But look at this — I wake up in the trees, and there's a real oak trunk two blocks north of me at (29,70,-107). First log of my life. Let's take it down by the foot.","motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":"world","thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D14:005","anchor":{"citizen_day":14,"wall_utc":"2026-11-10T07:06:14Z"},"kind":"death","place":"the pocket","what":"Death 134: zombie slew Cody 07:06:14Z in the pocket east of home (77.7,64,-98.3), mid-craft (cycle 29); his goods, pickaxe among them, dropped there. A rain-gloom death under canopy: floor held TIME (4/4 attempt 1), not weather. (Ordinal by query.)","evidence":[{"src":"deaths_record","ref":"row n=134, cause 'Zombie (slain)', cause_verified true","sha":"dde8cd7d7b9d"},{"src":"trace","ref":"day-14 trace death row n=2 at 2026-11-10T07:06:14.117Z; his cycle-30 say fixes the place in his own words","sha":"f6231f78590d"}],"observations":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"bookkeeping note filed in the record: cycle 29's trace row is stamped at the death instant but its position reads the post-respawn landing — an interrupted cycle's row samples position at flush, not at death; the driver log's line order is the discriminating store"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"frame account corroborates the weather: rain visible in 3/6 sampled frames (07:06, 07:07, 07:08) — the exposure documented in the frames themselves"}],"seq":107,"prev_sha256":"b37ac92c28e0b1af889c7e8738f62eb87057bbc636dae4fc88efbb6b5c4a8d48","written_utc":"2026-11-10T15:27:02.098Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-seal-11-17","version":"1.0.0"}}
{"subject":"cody","narration":"Well — the walker carried me right into the dip while I was crafting. But look: my own table from yesterday is two blocks south, and I'm standing, fed, whole. While I'm here I'll use it.","motive_ref":null,"fault_owner":"harness","thread":null,"status":"sealed","supersedes":null,"corrects":null,"observations_gap":null,"id":"b:D14:006","anchor":{"citizen_day":14,"wall_utc":"2026-11-10T07:02:09Z"},"kind":"crew_fault","place":"the pocket","what":"Incident I4 — walker doesn't stop when a command ends: between cycles 10-11 ((50.4,68,-109.9) -> (76.6,64.8,-99.5)) the body moved ~26 blocks east with NO movement command in either row; both cycles were crafts. A stale pathfinder goal carried him into the pocket east of home.","evidence":[{"src":"trace","ref":"day-14 trace cycles 10-12 — two craft rows, ~26 blocks of displacement between them, no movement command","sha":"f6231f78590d"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"DIRECT-DRIVE-DAY14-20261109.md — Incident I4 (harness): 'displacement with no command at all'","sha":"0e5172aa74ab"}],"observations":[{"src":"day_record","ref":"the citizen named it himself at cycle 12 — the narration above is the defect reported by the body it happened to"},{"src":"day_record","ref":"the fence's later account: shipped fixture-proven 18/18; day 15's mechanical pass found zero displacement during stationary verbs (verdict arm (i): invariant held unforced); day 16 likewise 0 rows — shipped, proven on fixtures, live-unfired through day 16"}],"seq":108,"prev_sha256":"f0ada5e2cea1e436124c280b55ee46a135f0c4da6f67c17bc565330f3e346912","written_utc":"2026-11-10T15:27:02.098Z","writer":{"process":"chronicle-seal-11-17","version":"1.0.0"}}
